#!/usr/bin/env python4
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
🎩 Nureal Thomas v3.0 — agent edition

Built around what NVIDIA says Nemotron 3.5 Lightning is for:
fast, always-on, multi-step agent work with tool calling and reasoning.

  * real agent loop: tool results go BACK to the model, it chains tools,
    checks its own work and retries, then answers (up to 14 steps a turn)
  * parallel tool calls handled
  * safe tools just run; only risky ones (rm, sudo, deleting, editing
    outside your home, touching keys) ask yes / no
  * web search, page fetch, weather, files, shell, Python, Terminal
  * persistent memory and chat history (survives restarts)
  * background tasks: "every 30 minutes check that page and tell me if
    it changed" — runs on its own and messages you on Telegram
  * ask_alfred: talks to the running Alfred over his own bridge (allowlisted commands)
  * Telegram text + voice notes in, text + voice notes out
Alfred is not touched by this file.
"""

